  {
   "text": {
    "la": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Hæc est virgo sápiens, quam Dóminus vigilántem invénit, quæ accéptis lampádibus sumpsit secum óleum et, veniénte Dómino, introívit cum eo ad núptias ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(T. P. "
        },
        "allelúia",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")."
        }
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "en-US": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Here is a wise virgin whom the Lord found watching; when they took up their lamps she brought oil with her and when the Lord came she went in with him to the wedding feast ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(E. T. "
        },
        "alleluia",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")"
        },
        "."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "es": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Esta es la virgen sabia que el Señor encontró vigilante, con el aceite de su lámpara preparado y, al llegar el Señor, entró con él en el banquete de bodas ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(T. P."
        },
        " Aleluya",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")"
        },
        "."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "it": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Esta es la virgen sabia que el Señor encontró vigilante, con el aceite de su lámpara preparado y, al llegar el Señor, entró con él en el banquete de bodas ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(T. P."
        },
        " Alleluia",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")"
        },
        "."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "fr": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Que tu es belle, vierge du Christ !"
       ],
       [
        "Tu as mérité de recevoir la couronne du Seigneur,"
       ],
       [
        "la couronne de la virginité à jamais ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "(T. P. "
        },
        "alléluia",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": ")."
        }
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
